---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BUSINESS } from '../../consts';
---
<Layout title="Septic Tank Pumping Niagara Falls, NY" description="Professional septic tank pumping in Niagara Falls, Wilson, and Western New York. Protect your drain field with scheduled maintenance.">
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Septic Tank Pumping</h1>
			<p>Complete, professional pumping that removes sludge and protects your system.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="content-block">
		<div class="container prose">
			<h2>Reliable Septic Tank Pumping for Western New York Homes</h2>
			<p>
				Regular pumping is the single most important thing you can do for a septic system.
				Solids build up over time; if left too long they migrate into the drain field and cause costly failures.
				We provide thorough residential and light commercial septic tank pumping across Niagara Falls, Wilson, and nearby communities.
			</p>
			<h3>What’s Included</h3>
			<ul>
				<li>Locate and access tank lids or risers</li>
				<li>Complete removal of liquid, sludge, and scum</li>
				<li>Visual check of baffles and condition when accessible</li>
				<li>Filter cleaning when present</li>
				<li>Proper disposal at approved facilities</li>
				<li>Recommendations for next service interval</li>
			</ul>
			<h3>How Often Should You Pump?</h3>
			<p>
				Most households need pumping every 3–5 years depending on tank size, household size, and water use.
				Homes with garbage disposals, high occupancy, or smaller tanks may need more frequent service.
				We help you set a realistic schedule so you never get surprised by a backup.
			</p>
			<p style="margin-top:1.75rem">
				<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-navy">Request a Pumping Quote</a>
				<a href={`tel:${BUSINESS.phoneTel}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-left:0.5rem">Call {BUSINESS.phone}</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
